    {
      "index": 14,
      "tag": "div",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "flex-vertical whitney theme-dark"
      },
      "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMelee attacks \n⬥ The King Black Dragon can bite or swipe at the player, dealing up to 1,000  damage.\n    • The player can use  to reduce this damage.\n​\nFire Breath\n⬥ The King Black Dragon can use regular dragonfire, hitting up 4,000 typeless damage\n    • The player should: use dragonfire protection, like super antifire potions  to strongly reduce this damage.\n        • If F2P: use  (recommended for   ) or anti-dragon shield.\n​ Click to view an example\nFrostfire Breath\n⬥ A freezing type of dragonfire, which binds the player in place for a short duration.\n    • Note: This attack can hit up to 1,000 damage through \n​Click to view an example\nToxic Breath\n⬥ A venomous type of dragonfire, which inflicts the player with poison  This can be mitigated by a variety of antipoison potions \n    • Note: This attack can hit up to 1,000 damage through \n​ Click to view an example\nCharged Breath\n⬥ A shocking type of dragonfire that deals dragonfire damage, as well as slightly reducing your skill levels and prayer points.\n    • Note: This attack can hit up to 1,000 damage through \n​ Click to view an example\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 163984,
        "end": 168259
      }
    },
